Subject: [PATCH] CSV/TSV parser+writer intrinsics: indexOf+substring fast path
         + direct StringBuilder.append(long/int/double) on typed writers

Applies on top of 3.0.97 (commit c73088300a3ca7eb78c3203639d751087dd6500a).

--- a/diesel/storage/CsvRowReader.java
